### (b) THE DELOAD TRIGGER: the same block plus three extra sessions this week.
#
# Observed: state "spike", acute 2520 vs 1365 weekly average, ratio 1.85.
# load_multiplier 0.75, dose_outcome "varied_for_load_management".
# 4x8@80 (volume 2560, 456s) -> 3x12@52.5 (volume 1890, 453s).
#
# Note what did NOT move: the session is 453 seconds either way. A week's
# accumulated load is a reason to lift lighter, never a reason to go home early
# -- session length comes from the user's calendar.
